{"id":"nf001fe3e42","headline":"Rupiah Closes Stable as MSCI Effect Fades","summary":"The rupiah closed stable at 17,877 per US dollar. Euphoria over the MSCI index review is fading, and the market is awaiting the direction of Bank Indonesia's policy.","why":"The rupiah's level against the dollar affects Indonesia's import costs, inflation and foreign portfolio flows, and Bank Indonesia sets the policy rate that influences it.","category":"markets","event_type":"other","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Jakarta","country":"Indonesia","lat":-6.209,"lon":106.846,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"liputan6.com","url":"https://www.liputan6.com/bisnis/read/8269202/rupiah-ditutup-stabil-efek-msci-mulai-memudar"},"sources":[{"name":"liputan6.com","url":"https://www.liputan6.com/bisnis/read/8269202/rupiah-ditutup-stabil-efek-msci-mulai-memudar"}],"published_at":"2026-08-13T11:35:25Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-13T08:34:43Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"ffa5c4204e96cb90","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-13T08:34:43Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-13T11:35:25Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-13T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"ID","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"Rupiah Ditutup Stabil, Efek MSCI Mulai Memudar","source_language":"ind","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/banknotes-money-3100563.jpg","alt":"banknotes money (illustration)","credit":"Ralphs_Fotos","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/handshake-agreement-trade-business-3100563/"}}